    "https://support.google.com/docs/answer/1696717?hl=en&co=GENIE.Platform%3DDesktop"
  ],
  "note": "Current web editor, PC/ChromeOS and Mac columns. 'Video Player | Seek to a specific point' (Shift+0..Shift+9, jumping to 0%-90% of the clip) is expanded into 10 individual actions. 'Go to a specific slide' (type a number, then Enter) and 'return from a blank slide' (press any key) are not expressible as a fixed chord and are omitted, as are the mouse-drag-only object shortcuts (suppress guides, duplicate/resize/rotate while dragging with a modifier held).",
